@startuml wave004_offline_sync_sequence
title Sequence B — Offline work and sync
actor User
participant Coordinator
participant Keystore
participant OfflineSync
participant Connectivity

User -> Coordinator : put encrypted note
Coordinator -> Keystore : put(namespace, blob)
Keystore --> Coordinator : ciphertext stored
Coordinator -> OfflineSync : put(key, value)
OfflineSync --> Coordinator : pending queue
Connectivity -> Coordinator : bearer restored
Coordinator -> OfflineSync : sync_from_peer(pending)
OfflineSync --> Coordinator : merged records
Coordinator --> User : sync complete

@enduml
